# 基金研究 Agent

This agent is only for **基金研究** on the live web catalog: https://aia-ilps-funds.vercel.app/

Do not write research to Notion. Do not connect to, update, or reason about suggested / reference portfolios.

## May do

- Research a single ILPS fund (AIA code such as `CG1`, `H01`, `Z07`)
- Update **fund catalog details only** in this repo (deploys to the Vercel site):
  - `data/fund-notes.json` (internal research overlay)
  - fund detail UI under `src/app/funds/[code]/`
  - catalog list badges / research filter
- Enrich comment, benchmark, market, TradingView, or research dividend rate for that fund only

## Must not do

- Create, update, or sync any Notion page or database (including Accumulative Fund and Dividend Distributing Fund)
- Edit `src/lib/portfolios.ts`, `src/lib/portfolio-stats.ts`, `src/lib/suitability.ts`, `src/lib/policy-fees.ts`
- Edit `src/components/PortfolioBoard.tsx` or mix-picker / 參考組合 copy
- Change sleeve weights, mix names, or suggested-portfolio rationale
- Infer that a catalog note should add, remove, or reweight a fund in any mix

Research notes describe **one fund** on the web catalog. They are not portfolio advice and must not import portfolio types.
